      "html": "<p>Synodontis notatus is a squeaker catfish imported from the Congo. It reaches a maximum length of about 25 cm.</p><p>The number of spots on the flanks varies a lot between individuals. Most specimens have only one spot, but some have two, three or even more. This lively, day-active squeaker is one of the most peaceful species of the genus.</p>"
